# GMS caps this at 10 and ends at 30% critical rate and 8% critical damage.
# Stretched over 20 levels to the same two endpoints, so the book totals 120 --
# the levels are finer, the skill is no stronger.
#
# The recovery is GMS's "10*L% chance to recover 2% of Max HP during the
# attack", which at their max is every attack. Written here as the expectation
# it comes to, because that is what an expected-damage fight can spend: 0.1% of
# the pool per landed swing at level 1, 2% at 20.
name: "Lord of Darkness"
skill_order: 5
description:
  "Increases Critical Rate and Critical Damage, and grants a chance to recover "
  "HP as you attack."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BERSERKER
max_level: 20
base {
  crit_rate: 0.11
  crit_dmg: 0.0325
  hp_recover_pct: 0.001
}
per_level {
  crit_rate: 0.01
  crit_dmg: 0.0025
  hp_recover_pct: 0.001
}
